KILL TRANSACTION -> KILL TRANSACTION ON *.*
KILL PART_MOVE_TO_SHARD -> SELECT ON system.part_moves_between_shards
SYSTEM STOP THREAD FUZZER -> SYSTEM THREAD FUZZER ON *.*
SYSTEM START THREAD FUZZER -> SYSTEM THREAD FUZZER ON *.*
SYSTEM RESET COVERAGE -> SYSTEM ON *.*
KILL TRANSACTION without system.transactions -> SELECT ON system.transactions
KILL PART_MOVE_TO_SHARD without move privileges -> ALTER MOVE PARTITION, MOVE PARTITION BETWEEN SHARDS ON *.*
no CLUSTER grant -> CLUSTER ON *.*
KILL TRANSACTION local -> allowed
KILL TRANSACTION on cluster -> allowed
KILL PART_MOVE_TO_SHARD local -> allowed
KILL PART_MOVE_TO_SHARD on cluster -> allowed
